Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O has won the Satsuki Sho!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That was... pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor physical condition leading up to the race...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,left me unable to run at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard only for it to come to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that ever happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show them... at the Japanese Derby...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan, I'm going to win it for you.
