Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:04.85,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HCB21DB&\fad(480,480)\pos(352.5,960)}Episode 2: A Glorious Stage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.97,Default top,,0,0,0,,We're left with just one more day to go\Nuntil the Japanese Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:04.60,Default top,,0,0,0,,Who can we expect to take the crown in a race that every Umamusume dreams of entering?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:09.00,Default top,,0,0,0,,The victorious are nothing less than champions of a generation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:12.85,Default,,1,1,0,,Everyone expected the Satsuki Sho to simply be a one-on-one race to the finish between Narita Top Road and Admire Vega,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but then we saw T.M. Opera O swoop in to win it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be T.M. Opera O again.\NDid you see that Satsuki Sho performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Nakayama Racecourse and\NTokyo Racecourse are just too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road's gonna have all the time in the world on Tokyo's straightaways to build up some blazin' speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know that it's going to be Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Ayabe's going to zip right on past everyone at the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road is definitely going to take it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Paces are average across the board. The pitch gradually increases as—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of got caught up in a panic here\Nsince I was blocked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind went totally blank for a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had been a bit more aggressive in coming up with a strategy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like some of that clumsiness crept out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The turf was pretty damp due to the rain right before the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:02.20,Default,,1,1,0,,Nakayama also has those small turns that give\Nsomeone like you with a big stride quite the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chalking it up to all of that, you simply weren't able to run like you're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So given the right conditions to\Nallow you to run at your fullest potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd be absolutely second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that the training\Nwe've done jilts us in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The upcoming race presents a golden opportunity to run
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,like you are used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to focus on honing those strengths of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A golden opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.85,0:04:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck at the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll definitely be seeing us in the stands!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, don't pile on the pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to earn you\Nthe title of Derby Trainer for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man... she's somethin' else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This staircase is akin to the\NGrand Staircase at Palais Garnier itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I will be stepping up onto\Nthe very stage of dreams, the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Apollo himself prepares to descend\Nfrom the skies in honor of my victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd expect... no less... from you, Opera O-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at... you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my dear scribes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to make the rounds one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind waiting for my return?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Please grace us with\Nan interview once you've finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The reporters just keep on increasing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't ignore my blinding aura\Nsince my victory at the Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be crowned the one and only\NOverlord of this generation of runners...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story too tantalizing to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I-if it were me, I'd just shy away because of all the cameras...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd best get used to it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.15,Default,,1,1,0,,I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:39.60,Default,,1,1,0,,you, too will one day come to bask in the\Npassionate anticipation and delight of the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, let us depart for one more round, Doto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To the summit of glory we run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san, if you haven't gone to\Ndinner yet, would you like to go with—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.84,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\frz25.3\pos(628.889,482.778)\c&H000000&}Staying out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:10.84,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\frz25.3\c&H000000&\pos(745.556,597.778)}I have permission from the dorm head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight is the night of a new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange. On nights of the new moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel her presence close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Of my dearest unborn sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little, and every time I ran...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That joy and excitement one naturally experiences...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,would quickly turn to\Nfeelings of acute sadness after.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That sadness was so unlike the usual me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the feelings of another well up from within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, I was told everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That I actually had a twin sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,before we were born, it was determined that only one of us could survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That one ended up being me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was at that time that I came to realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That those feelings of another...\NI would experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They were those of my sister\Nwho sacrificed herself for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only by mere chance that I was the one to live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do now is run for her sake... for my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,who's unable to do so on...\Nher own two feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for that pathetic display.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of the Japanese Derby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Umamusume who wins...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is considered to stand at\Nthe apex of a generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to outrun both Top Road and Opera O.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That Opera O... She's quite peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a flair for the dramatic and is ridiculously confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You could even say that\Nshe gets under my skin a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't underestimate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road possesses great ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and is always pushing herself further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She even sees me as an ideal to aspire toward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling someone something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Most would feel pretty embarrassed, wouldn't they? But not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a certain dazzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's one that\NI don't want to be outshone by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You loved running so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry... Because of me... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to make your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win the Derby,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and dedicate the title of strongest Umamusume to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, energetic as always, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot at the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Top Road-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there to cheer you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare to see you leave anything on your plate, Top Road-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you no appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps... are you feeling ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of have a lot on my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.41,0:12:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, this is great! So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under a lot of pressure, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you can't even avoid being reminded of the Derby these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always working\Nso hard though, Top Road-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Top Road-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We all pitched in to get these charms for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take them, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We all aspire to run just like you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give it your all at the Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that you'll be the champ, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm not going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese Derby...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A turf race at 2,400 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo Racecourse features long straightaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That should allow her to\Nmaintain her speeds quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the conditions are in play to let her freely stretch those legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Conscientiously, reliably, flawlessly... I need to give it my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san and I have worked\Ntirelessly to perfect this run of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know... I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out here quite late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You as well. Have you been\Ntraining this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want nothing more than to win the Japanese Derby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Satsuki Sho was so crushing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Running with you is going to make this the race of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be giving my all to this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's both run without any regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I knew that you would both be out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san. Ayabe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,On this illustrious evening\Nbefore our performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot help but feel restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to deliver a\Nproclamation unto both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A proclamation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to realize it a midst\Nour battle at the Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand before me as rivals in my path toward becoming Overlord of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese Derby approaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall show you exactly what I am capable of...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at this once-in-a-lifetime production.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that both of you will do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting us know.\NBut I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I shan't have it any other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A passionate contest awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Ayabe-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us chase the joy of victory together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it our all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my own goal to focus on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The day has finally come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Classic race in which bright-eyed Umamusume seek to ascend to the pinnacle of a generation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese Derby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This year is on the battle between three contenders in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. T.M. Opera O, Admire Vega,\Nand Narita Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Any one of them could easily emerge victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You lack nothing compared to anyone else out there. All that remains is putting your best foot forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the winner of\Nthe Satsuki Sho, T.M. Opera O.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she win the Derby and go on\Nto be a Triple Crown Umamusume?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is Admire Vega, who regrettably placed sixth at the Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's no doubt poised to win the Derby, and is today's second-favorite to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for our third-place finisher at the Satsuki Sho.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeking a grand comeback is Narita Top Road, today's favorite to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,High expectations ride on her shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Umamusume are making their way to the starting gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, my rivals! Hear you the thunderous applause?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They are cheers in our honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment of jubilation is forthwith!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our very dreams are at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us give it our all, and make this the greatest of performances!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The race has started!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 16, Nautical Tool, is off to a slow start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is running mostly in-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O is running with the pack.\NNarita Top Road follows closely behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O makes a good mark.\NJust be sure to keep up with her, Top Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Top Road-san, fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera O-san, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega makes the bold decision to keep up the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's running third to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Paces are average across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Each runner has a distinct placement. How will they proceed from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road continues to chase after T.M. Opera O and the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The runners are emerging from\Nthe third turn and into the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The trailing Umamusume are closing the gap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road and T.M. Opera O make the turn from the far edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Time now to sound the victory hymn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fast! Very fast! T.M. Opera O emerges from the turn at incredible speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road chases close behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can T.M. Opera O push to the lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega also emerges from the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All that remains is the homestretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:56.00,Default,,1,1,0,,T.M. Opera O! And from the outside,\NNarita Top Road! It's T.M. Opera O and Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:21:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has led to this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This time... for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Running on the outside, Admire Vega! Admire Vega is pushing fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,200 meters to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to win... against those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For Trainer-san, for everything he's done for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For everyone who has always cheered me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in my run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From the center advances Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road takes the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Push, push!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, don't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From the outside comes Admire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,From the outside comes Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayabe-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road! Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.45,0:22:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O in third,\Nthen it's Narita Top Road and Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're neck and neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The supreme victory of the Japanese Derby lies in their sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road, Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.70,0:23:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road, Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road, Admire Vega!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Narita Top Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega! Admire Vega has won!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Casting aside her loss at the Satsuki Sho,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.05,0:23:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Admire Vega has become a first-class shining star!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:06.75,Top,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My running was flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave it my absolute all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.83,0:24:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.78,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was expecting so much of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.59,0:25:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Trainer-san had placed all of his faith in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.40,0:25:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't win...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.20,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You did good, kid.

